        <mxCell id="80" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A5560;fontSize=10;" value="The partition is redrawn every round. Pairwise secrets with all peers are established once in (A), so re-clustering costs no additional KEM operations — this is what makes temporal group testing affordable." vertex="1">
